{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47303","headline":"步虚词十首 二 · 吴筠","name":"步虚词十首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"逸辔登紫清，乘光迈奔电。\n阆风隔三天，俯视犹可见。\n玉闼摽敞朗，琼林郁葱蒨。\n自非挺金骨，焉得谐夙愿。\n真朋何森森，合景恣游宴。\n良会忘淹留，千龄才一眄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}